{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提多书","commonName":"提多书","title":"提多书","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"e5705f43b4e1797b51a37f17144eb8297b5ae653662435ba9ce15dfaced77ad2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["教导纯正的教义"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你的教导要符合纯正的教义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["劝年长的男子要节制、庄重、自律，有全备的信心、爱心和耐心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["劝年长的妇女要过敬虔的生活，不说长道短，不做酒的奴隶，要以身作则。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这样，她们就能教导年轻的妇女爱丈夫、爱儿女、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["自制、贞洁、持家、和善、顺服丈夫，免得上帝的道被人毁谤。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["劝勉年轻的男子要自制。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己要在各样善行上做众人的榜样，在教导上要诚恳、认真、"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["言语纯全、无可指责，让那些反对的人无话可说、自觉羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["劝勉做奴仆的要凡事顺服主人，让主人满意，不顶撞主人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不偷拿主人的东西，为人要忠信可靠，好凡事尊崇我们救主上帝的教导。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为上帝拯救世人的恩典已经显明了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这恩典教导我们除掉不敬虔的心和世俗的私欲，在今世过自律、公义、敬畏上帝的生活，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["怀着美好的盼望等候我们伟大的上帝和救主耶稣基督的荣耀显现。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["主耶稣为我们牺牲自己，要救赎我们脱离一切罪恶，并洁净我们，使我们做祂热心行善的子民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你要讲明这些事，充分运用权柄来劝勉人、责备人，别让人轻看你。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}